sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Field Officer
    participant App as Flutter app<br/>(visit_screen.dart)
    participant REPO as Repository
    participant Local as Local SQLite<br/>(sqflite)
    participant API as ApiClient
    participant BE as Spring Boot jar<br/>(SyncController)
    participant H2 as H2 DB

    Note over U,App: Edits BP / Hb / danger signs →<br/>computeAncRisk() re-classifies live (no network)

    U->>App: tap "Save visit · সংরক্ষণ"
    App->>REPO: recordAncVisit(id, risk, next)
    REPO->>Local: UPDATE beneficiaries SET risk,next
    REPO->>Local: INSERT INTO sync_queue (visit)
    App-->>U: profile updated (works fully offline)

    Note over U,App: Later, when online, taps "Sync"
    U->>App: tap "Sync"
    App->>REPO: flushSyncQueue()
    REPO->>Local: SELECT * FROM sync_queue
    REPO->>API: POST /api/sync { items[] }
    API->>BE: batched queue
    BE-->>API: { acknowledgedRefIds }
    Note right of BE: a production build would<br/>persist these into H2 here
    REPO->>Local: DELETE acknowledged rows from sync_queue
